          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("Drakes, human, dwarves... vermin, all of them! I offered them a chance at peace, at purpose! A chance to be part of something greater than themselves — my great golden Empire!!! And this is the thanks I get?"),
